      "id": "msg_0499_T07R0106_CeladonCity_DepartmentStore_Roof_Text_NotThirsty",
      "en_US": "Not thirsty!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0499_T07R0106_CeladonCity_DepartmentStore_Roof_Text_StillStuck",
      "en_US": [
        "Ahh, that’s all of them!\r",
        "…But my drink’s Still stuck in that\n",
        "dumb machine!\r",
        "Hmph! Take this!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0499_T07R0106_CeladonCity_DepartmentStore_Roof_Text_DrinkCameOut",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh! My drink came out!\r",
        "…But I already have all these.\n",
        "Here, you can have it!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0499_T07R0106_CeladonCity_DepartmentStore_Roof_Text_TakeTheMachine",
      "en_US": [
        "And the store’s throwing that\n",
        "machine out anyway.\r",
        "You have a gym, right?\n",
        "Put it in your gym!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0499_T07R0106_CeladonCity_DepartmentStore_Roof_Text_ReceivedDrinkMachine",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} received the\n",
        "Drink Machine!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0499_T07R0106_CeladonCity_DepartmentStore_Roof_Text_ExplainDrinkMachine",
      "en_US": [
        "Set it up from the PC in your gym!\r",
        "Put in a drink and some Berries,\n",
        "and it mixes them into medicine!\r",
        "And if you mix that Soda with a\n",
        "type Berry… something cool happens!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0499_T07R0106_CeladonCity_DepartmentStore_Roof_Text_MasteredAType",
      "en_US": [
        "You mastered a new type? Wow!\n",
        "Here, have another one!"
      ]
